--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

SysPerf depends on the following packages at runtime. They are installed from
PyPI at install time and are not redistributed as part of this repository.

  Flask (BSD-3-Clause)     — https://palletsprojects.com/p/flask/
  Waitress (ZPL-2.1)       — https://github.com/Pylons/waitress

The dashboard front end uses no third-party JavaScript or CSS. All charts are
hand-written SVG, so the page loads nothing from a network and works offline.

